{"id":"tot","lemma":"тот","pos":"pron","rank":83,"glosses":["that one, those ones (something distal to an observer)","that, the one; in the plural: those, the ones","the person, the guy/girl/etc.; in the plural: the people etc."],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/49/Ru-%D1%82%D0%BE%D1%82.ogg/Ru-%D1%82%D0%BE%D1%82.ogg.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"та","plural":"те","neuter":"то"},"formAudio":{"то":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a0/LL-Q7737_%28rus%29-Lvova--%D1%82%D0%BE.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Посмотри на те.","en":"Look at those.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/651131","words":[{"g":"to look","l":"посмотреть"},{"g":"on / at"},null]},{"text":"Кто тот мужчина?","en":"Who is that man?","words":[{"g":"who"},null,{"g":"man"}]},{"text":"Должно быть, та женщина - его жена.","en":"That woman must be his wife.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/655885","words":[{"g":"it must be, probably"},{"g":"to be"},null,{"g":"woman"},{"g":"him / his"},{"g":"wife"}]},{"text":"Ты помнишь тот день?","en":"Do you remember that day?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to remember","l":"помнить"},null,{"g":"day, daytime"}]},{"text":"Что делают те дети?","en":"What are those children doing?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1274741","words":[{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"делать"},null,{"g":"child","l":"ребёнок"}]}]}